    "type": "talk_topic",
    "dynamic_line": "Oh, I'm just scavenging out here for various odds and ends: food, canned goods, old robots, weapons, things of that nature.  It's somewhat difficult at times, but I think it's fulfilling.  Oh, I'm just scavenging out here for various odds and ends: food, canned goods, old robots, weapons, things of that nature.  It's somewhat difficult at times, but I think it's fulfilling.",
